OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits murdering mum-of-four
OL,4,Aby stabbing her in the back
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted murdering a
OL,7,Fmum-of-four by stabbing her in the back
OL,8,Ffollowing a fight.
OL,10,FCharlene Dowsell, 41, died on 18 July
OL,11,Foutside a property in St Vincent Road,
OL,12,Fnear Newport city centre.
OL,14,FArmed officers from Gwent Police were
OL,15,Fcalled to the scene at 01:37 BST and
OL,16,Fwere told Dowsell was bleeding.
OL,18,FShe was found a short distance away
OL,19,Fnear Chepstow Road, and was pronounced
OL,20,Fdead at 03:15, after attempts to save
OL,21,Fher failed.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
